						<div class="article-heading-info">
							<h1 class="article-heading">
								NBCUniversal Has Reached a Two-Year Agreement to Sell VERSANT Advertising Inventory Under One Platform Banner
							</h1>

															<p class="article-descriptions">NBCUniversal’s Mark Marshall to Manage All Sales Strategy and Revenue;  Industry Veteran Tom Winiarski Moves to VERSANT to Lead the Sales Partnership Between Entities </p>
													</div>
